{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"Keyboard layouts, typists and sessions","title_html":"Keyboard layouts, typists and sessions","html":"<p>In a synthetic experiment, five typists each type a standard passage\nin five sessions, comparing five keyboard layouts. Typists differ\ngreatly, and speed rises with practice. A randomized <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"5\\times5\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> Latin square gives each layout\nonce to each typist and once in each session: <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\begin{array}{c|ccccc}\n& \\text{S1} & \\text{S2} & \\text{S3} & \\text{S4} &\n\\text{S5}\\\\\\hline\n\\text{typist 1} & 2 & 3 & 1 & 4 & 5\\\\\n\\text{typist 2} & 3 & 5 & 4 & 2 & 1\\\\\n\\text{typist 3} & 5 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4\\\\\n\\text{typist 4} & 4 & 2 & 5 & 1 & 3\\\\\n\\text{typist 5} & 1 & 4 & 3 & 5 & 2\n\\end{array}\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 13.634em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: 0.5em; border-left: .07em solid; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c53\"></mjx-c><mjx-c cla